    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
ASK { gmeow:isFalse a owl:DatatypeProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:isFalse MUST NOT be declared an owl:DatatypeProperty -- a falsehood is a refuted StandpointClaim modality, never a boolean flag (Principles 1, 12; no-isFalse doctrine). Mirrors test_no_is_false_axiom (isFalse DatatypeProperty part)." .

