ASK { gmeow:eventTypeBullshit a gmeow:EventType . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:eventTypeBullshit MUST exist as a gmeow:EventType individual -- bullshit event type (Frankfurt indifference-to-truth; distinct from lie and error, issue #215). Mirrors test_event_type_bullshit_exists." .

