# --- 31. eventTypeDisinformation exists as an EventType individual (MUST) -----
ex:saEventTypeDisinformationExists a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:eventTypeDisinformation a gmeow:EventType . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:eventTypeDisinformation MUST exist as a gmeow:EventType individual -- disinformation is the coordinated propagation type; the misinfo/disinfo boundary is per-node (issue #217). Mirrors test_event_type_disinformation_exists." .
